{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 7940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4460, "text": "I got an extra ticket here for the\nRangers -Bruins game tonight. You"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 11980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9620, "text": "Rats. That's the sixth person who turned\nme down."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 17280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13060, "text": "You know Art? Yeah. I've never been to a\nhockey game. Oh, it's the best. A"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 18340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17280, "text": "regular guy's night out."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 22840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18700, "text": "Sticks swinging, bodies crashing, crowds\ncursing. And that's just on the subway."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 30560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25900, "text": "Well, maybe there's somebody else around\nhere who would enjoy a guy's night out."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 32800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31480, "text": "Of course. What was I thinking about?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 34380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33180, "text": "Carlotta, you like ice hockey?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 37780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36780, "text": "I'm stumped."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 46060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42360, "text": "Oh, Tammy, it was a wonderful afternoon."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 47980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46540, "text": "Oh, which part did you like best?"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 52300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48300, "text": "The rowboat in Central Park or tossing\ndaisy petals into the lily pond?"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 54660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52840, "text": "My favorite was the petting zoo."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 59580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57580, "text": "I've never fed a koala before."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 67750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64269, "text": "Dan, you are the sweetest, most\nsensitive man I've ever met."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 69290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68290, "text": "Love you."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 73390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71830, "text": "See you later."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 75470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74470, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 77410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76410, "text": "that's a new approach."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 80690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77870, "text": "What is? Your new seduction technique."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 85950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81530, "text": "A spoonful of sugar helps the babe come\naround."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 90870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 88590, "text": "Matt, don't be so vulgar."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 97000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92010, "text": "You know, This Phil Foundation\nexperience has given me a whole new"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 98160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 97000, "text": "of the fairer sex."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 103000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98740, "text": "I look at women differently now, kind of\nlike people."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 108600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105260, "text": "Bad news for people, good news for\nsluts."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 112640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110760, "text": "Hey, Roz, guess what just came for you?"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 114680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113680, "text": "Flowers?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 116320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115160, "text": "Who snitched?"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 120760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 118840, "text": "Looks like someone has a secret admirer."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 126160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 123560, "text": "holding. He had a little thing for you."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 129100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 127260, "text": "He had a little thing for everybody."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 131940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 130940, "text": "I'll be damned."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 133940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 132500, "text": "Eugene Westfall."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 135680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134240, "text": "Eugene Westfall."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 136940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 135940, "text": "Impressive name."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 138020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 137020, "text": "Sounds like a professor."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 140720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138260, "text": "Sounds like a banker. Sounds like a\nhusband."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 142680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 141680, "text": "Mine."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 149820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 144640, "text": "Like sand through an hourglass, so are\nthe days of our lives."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 197360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 195660, "text": "You think you know someone after all\nthese years?"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 199240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 198100, "text": "When did you get married?"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 200800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 199800, "text": "Prom night."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 205360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201160, "text": "Eugene was lead singer of the\nExpectations, the group that plays the"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 207500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206140, "text": "Wow, you were lucky."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 209700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 207920, "text": "We got stuck with Frank Sinatra."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 213920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 211740, "text": "So you fell for a musician, huh, Ross?"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 216960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214460, "text": "Yeah, Eugene really hit a high note with\nme."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 219080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217780, "text": "So what broke you guys up?"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 222780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 219880, "text": "Well, the day after our six -week\nanniversary..."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 228130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222990, "text": "Eugene traded in our sleeper couch,\nwhich was also our eater couch and our"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 233130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228130, "text": "TV -er couch, for a 67 Camaro."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 235230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233410, "text": "He said he wanted to go to Detroit."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 238210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235510, "text": "To fulfill his dream and sing in Motown?"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 241170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238730, "text": "No, it's easier to get Camaro parts\nthere."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 251610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244690, "text": "I told him I wasn't leaving Brooklyn\nuntil he got mad and I got mad and we"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 252610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251610, "text": "our separate ways."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 254260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252840, "text": "And you never heard from him again?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 255880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254800, "text": "Not till tonight."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 259180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256420, "text": "But the card says he's in town and wants\nto talk."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 260760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259560, "text": "So what are you going to do?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 262900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261459, "text": "I'm going to put these in water."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 267000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 265060, "text": "The people versus Sheena Easy."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 269940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268900, "text": "Hi, Sheena."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 271240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270240, "text": "Solicitation again?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 273560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 271560, "text": "It's my day off. Can't you tell?"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 275280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273980, "text": "These are my civvies."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 279220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277100, "text": "The charge is disturbing the peace."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 280960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279960, "text": "Your Honor."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 284240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281200, "text": "The defendant was buying a pack of gum\nwhen a fight broke out with the store"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 285240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284240, "text": "clerk."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 288620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285840, "text": "My client says the store clerk started\nit by overcharging her."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 290120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 289080, "text": "What did he charge you?"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 291700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 290380, "text": "$3 ,100."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 295520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294280, "text": "For a pack of gum?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 299020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295960, "text": "Hey, it's not just gum. It also freshens\nyour breath."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 303840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301180, "text": "Anyway, I don't make up the prices. I\njust read the register."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 308860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305460, "text": "Uh, wait a minute. Does your store by\nany chance have one of those devices"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 310040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308860, "text": "scans barcodes?"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 312810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310670, "text": "Well, what do you think we use? An\nabacus?"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 319630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 314330, "text": "Well, just maybe then, if Sheena leaned\nover the counter, the register rang up"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 321870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319630, "text": "$3 ,100 for her."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 328230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327130, "text": "I'm good, baby."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 331470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330150, "text": "But I'm not that good."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 341550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340550, "text": "Missed this."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 346830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343930, "text": "Hey, Missette. How about a game of\nhockey tonight after session?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 348070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347070, "text": "Oh, sorry."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 349130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348130, "text": "Weak ankles."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 354050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353050, "text": "Hello, Rosie."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 357730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356730, "text": "Hello, Eugene."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 359930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358530, "text": "Where the hell have you been?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 382220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380840, "text": "this would be a good time to take lunch."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 390120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389020, "text": "Someplace else."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 394760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393760, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 400960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394940, "text": "you look more or less the same."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 403600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401400, "text": "And you still look just as foxy as ever."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 406260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404040, "text": "And you still know how to lay it on\nthick."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 408760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407760, "text": "You still singing?"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 410480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409480, "text": "Only in the shower."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 412640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411180, "text": "I'm in the cardboard field now."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 415400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413980, "text": "Cardboard? That's a field?"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 419760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416880, "text": "Hey, it's a darn good job where I make a\ndarn good living."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 421640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420100, "text": "Well, I'll be darned."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 425480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423480, "text": "So, what brings you to New York?"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 427180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426180, "text": "Cardboard convention?"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 432100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427820, "text": "Or did you just slither in on your belly\nto beg my forgiveness, which I may be"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 434340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432100, "text": "willing to grant you under the proper\ncircumstances?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 437660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435400, "text": "Actually, I came back to bring you\nthese."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 440450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 439450, "text": "Divorce papers."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 447170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442250, "text": "Oh, we were having such a good time, and\nnow you want to ruin it by taking me to"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 448170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447170, "text": "court."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 451810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448570, "text": "I just think it's time that we got on\nwith our lives."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 454210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453210, "text": "Who is she?"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 456030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454730, "text": "Oh, you'd like a Rosie."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 460490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456870, "text": "But I can't do right by her until those\nare signed."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 464430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461410, "text": "Well, I wouldn't want our marriage to\nruin your honeymoon."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 466570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465570, "text": "I'll tell you what."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 469560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 466640, "text": "You take a couple hours to look those\nover, and I'll come back and pick them"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 470560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469560, "text": "later."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 477740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474820, "text": "And, Rosie, think of being all right\nwith this."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 484420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 483420, "text": "You okay?"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 486820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485820, "text": "I don't know."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 491620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487380, "text": "Oh, I know that feeling when you just\nwant to go up on a rooftop and scream, I"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 493840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491620, "text": "feel rejected, I feel hurt, I feel\nangry."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 496420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495020, "text": "I think I feel relieved."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 500040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498460, "text": "Relieved? What kind of stupid feeling is\nthat?"}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 509620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506480, "text": "Did you want to talk to me about\nsomething, Your Honor?"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 514340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509860, "text": "Uh, yeah, Art. Did you find anyone to\ngive that extra hockey ticket to?"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 516860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515820, "text": "Nope, and it's a shame."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 518740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517320, "text": "I'm just going to have to scalp it."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 520860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519400, "text": "Whoops, you didn't hear that, Your\nHonor."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 525800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522700, "text": "You know, there is somebody around here\nthat you haven't thought to ask yet."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 527880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526880, "text": "Roger's husband?"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 528900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527900, "text": "I thought he left."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 530900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529740, "text": "No, Art."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 532300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531300, "text": "Me."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 534600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533480, "text": "Hocus Pocus."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 539080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535300, "text": "It would be an honor to take you with\nme. I just never thought anybody I'd be"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 542720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 539080, "text": "flying as a judge would enjoy something\nas crude and undignified as hockey."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 544560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543040, "text": "It's not undignified, Art."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 550210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545320, "text": "See? Hockey combines the speed of horse\nracing, the hand -eye coordination of"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 552450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550210, "text": "polo, and the grace of ballet."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 555790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554210, "text": "Plus, it's a real bloodbath."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 559990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558050, "text": "I'll probably read during the fights."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 563370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560790, "text": "Yeah, it's going to be a real swell\nevening."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 573710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566890, "text": "Tammy and I, we just spent the most\nincredible lunch hour"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 575290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573710, "text": "together. Oh, really?"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 576930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 575930, "text": "What was the main course?"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 578850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 577510, "text": "Tammy a la mattress?"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 581450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580450, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 584410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582310, "text": "We went to an amusement park."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 587270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585250, "text": "I held her hand the entire time."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 589630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 588630, "text": "Why'd you hold it?"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 592450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 591230, "text": "On the Ferris wheel."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 597250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594110, "text": "She's inviting me back to her place for\ndinner tonight. Don't worry, I told her."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 599370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597290, "text": "I have to be home at a respectable hour."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 603590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600370, "text": "You think I should bring something? You\nknow, to sort of set the mood."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 606550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604510, "text": "Oh, you could bring some wine."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 609010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608010, "text": "Wine?"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 611030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609330, "text": "I was thinking something fun."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 613510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611830, "text": "Like chutes and ladders."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 617310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614650, "text": "Some women do get turned on by\nfirefighting equipment."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 619430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618390, "text": "No, Mac."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 621850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619890, "text": "I meant the board game."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 624890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 622530, "text": "Well, I mean, Dan, I don't know. I mean,\nshe's an adult."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 628630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626190, "text": "Maybe she doesn't want to play kids'\ngames."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 634780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633780, "text": "Absolutely right."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 638820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 635900, "text": "Better bring my Mahjong tiles."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 645240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641760, "text": "Roz, I can't let you sign these papers.\nThere's nothing in them about alimony."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 647300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645720, "text": "I don't need Eugene's money."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 649700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648520, "text": "Alimony isn't about need."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 651360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649920, "text": "It's about revenge."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 654940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653900, "text": "Well, good night, guys."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 656780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655220, "text": "Art and I are off to see the Rangers\ngame."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 658260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657260, "text": "Have a great time."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 659620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658620, "text": "Oh, we will."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 661340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660040, "text": "Two regular guys."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 663760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 662760, "text": "A hockey game."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 665460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 664280, "text": "French bread and brie."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 670840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668620, "text": "But you promised to wash it down with a\nbrewski, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 673260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671200, "text": "Sure. Unless they have a smart chablis."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 677920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 675240, "text": "Great. Section 229 will be ribbing me\nfor weeks."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 682800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681600, "text": "Oh, hello, Rosie."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 684640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683120, "text": "Had a chance to look over those papers?"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 686340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685120, "text": "Well, my lawyer has."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 688600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 687120, "text": "But I'm still going to sign them."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 693000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689680, "text": "I'm Christine Sullivan. I'm acting as\nRosalyn's attorney in this matter. Oh,"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 696080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693020, "text": "Jean Westfall. And this is my fiancée,\nGilda Fells."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 698860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696580, "text": "My, what an interesting work\nenvironment."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 701000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699380, "text": "Yes, and the work is quite rewarding."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 703520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701540, "text": "And you can dress casual."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 712720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710340, "text": "Gilda Fells, Rosalyn Russell."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 717080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713020, "text": "Oh, it's such a pleasure to meet you,\ndespite the painful circumstance of your"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 718080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717080, "text": "divorce."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 720050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718510, "text": "So let's sign these papers, shall we?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 723530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720470, "text": "My client still has a few outstanding\nquestions about the settlement."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 724950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723950, "text": "No, I don't."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 727790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 725970, "text": "Eugene and I couldn't make a go of it."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 730090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728710, "text": "I wish you all the best."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 732050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730410, "text": "Oh, isn't that sweet?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 734850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732750, "text": "No one would ever call you a sore loser."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 737430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736430, "text": "Got a pen."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 740410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738330, "text": "Eugene and I have an evening planned."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 744510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741070, "text": "Oh, you want my client to rush your\ndivorce so that you can make dinner?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 746830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744770, "text": "Oh, I never make."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 750550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749310, "text": "We're dining at Le Medu."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 752690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751410, "text": "Dining at Le Medu?"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 755690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 754130, "text": "You must be in Le Money."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 758430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756950, "text": "And we're in La Rush."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 762410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758990, "text": "Obviously, you've never tried to get\ndinner reservations at this hour."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 767190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763690, "text": "Obviously, she's never tried to get\ndinner reconstruction at this hour."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 775890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770430, "text": "Gilda, why not invite Rosie to dinner?\nWe can bring the papers with us."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 780380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776130, "text": "What? Uh, thanks anyway, but I don't\nthink that's a good idea. I have to"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 781860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780380, "text": "with my client. Me too."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 786680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782260, "text": "Oh, come on. We can talk about this over\ndinner. You can even bring your lawyer."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 788600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787600, "text": "We insist."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 789980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788840, "text": "Oh, yes, we insist."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 792220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791220, "text": "I'll bring the pen."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 794680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 792480, "text": "Eugene, I'll be waiting."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 802600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799800, "text": "Does she come with an off switch?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 807990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806990, "text": "She's not so bad."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 810410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808170, "text": "She's only that way when her blood sugar\ngets low."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 812590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810970, "text": "I'd like to lower it a few pints."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 818530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814750, "text": "Rosie, it would really mean a lot to me\nif you'd join us."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 822250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821210, "text": "Okay, we'll go."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 823770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822770, "text": "Oh, great."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 825970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 824890, "text": "I'll go help us a cab."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 830350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828990, "text": "Christine, what is your problem?"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 832090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830710, "text": "Roz, I don't like her."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 834370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832330, "text": "I don't trust her, and I don't like her."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 836450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834830, "text": "You said I don't like her twice."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 839120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837660, "text": "Because I really don't like her."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 844180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841140, "text": "Besides, I'm afraid you might lose your\ntemper and dropkick her over the dessert"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 845180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844180, "text": "cart."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 847820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 846220, "text": "Fine. Then you don't have to go."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 850300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848440, "text": "Are you kidding? I wouldn't miss that\nfor the world."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 856660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854860, "text": "Hmm. Some menu, huh?"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 858260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857000, "text": "There's something for everyone."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 861880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859800, "text": "Roz, have you seen the salad selection?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 867400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865360, "text": "Maybe she'd like to wear the salad\nselection."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 871460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869640, "text": "Oh, Christine, have you ever been\nmarried?"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 873740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 872020, "text": "Yes, but now I'm divorced."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 877160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874160, "text": "Oh, then you and Rosie have something in\ncommon."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 878299, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877380, "text": "Too bad."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 881160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 878300, "text": "It must be hard for single women over\n40."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 885900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 883580, "text": "I guess we'll find out."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 888420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887160, "text": "But she may not."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 891580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890320, "text": "Well, are you ready to order?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 894740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892580, "text": "Um, I'll have the bitch."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 905750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904750, "text": "Me too."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 908610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906710, "text": "Is that the bisque or the bitch?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 913670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912670, "text": "Silly question."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 917230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915690, "text": "I'll have the veal."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 920910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918890, "text": "And I'll have... Chicken."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 924130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922970, "text": "I'll have the chicken."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 926850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925090, "text": "Boneless? Isn't it obvious?"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 936060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 935020, "text": "I was like when you first met her."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 939160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936560, "text": "Reminiscing is so dull for those who\nweren't there."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 940600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 939600, "text": "Don't you agree?"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 942040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941040, "text": "Absolutely."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 945440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942660, "text": "Remember that gig the Expectations\nplayed at Coney Island?"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 950900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946020, "text": "Oh, yeah. We opened up for the\nimpressions, and what a windfall. We"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 951900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950900, "text": "bucks each."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 954580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952300, "text": "Then you and I celebrated on the\nboardwalk."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 959100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954880, "text": "Yeah, yeah. And I spent 49 of it trying\nto win you a $2 Cupid doll."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 962800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960780, "text": "It was a long walk home."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 965810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963290, "text": "You walked home from Coney Island in the\nmiddle of the night?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 968650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966930, "text": "Actually, we waited till the next\nmorning."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 971430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969850, "text": "We spent the night on the beach."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 976750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972830, "text": "And what a night it was. Is it possible\nto get some more bread over here?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 981870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978890, "text": "You know, back then, music was\neverything to you."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 985630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982230, "text": "How could you just give it up? He\ndoesn't have the time."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 990230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 986510, "text": "I mean, playing in a band might be fine\nfor an adolescent, but it's hardly"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 992470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990230, "text": "fitting for an up -and -coming cardboard\nexecutive."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 995450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993270, "text": "And Gene agrees completely."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 998670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996410, "text": "How would you know? You never let him\ntalk."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1002810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000850, "text": "I'm going to touch up my faith."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1004490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003310, "text": "Want to borrow my shrimp fork?"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1023920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022920, "text": "to have to go to court."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1025760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024460, "text": "We're not going to court."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1027200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026020, "text": "We will if I kill her."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1032220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1028500, "text": "God, how does he let her push him around\nlike that? I can't believe you were"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1033240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1032220, "text": "ever attracted to him."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1035680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033619, "text": "Christine, that's not the Eugene I\nmarried."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1039980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036200, "text": "My Eugene was self -confident,\nassertive, stubborn."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1042140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040640, "text": "What happened to him?"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1044079, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043079, "text": "I don't know."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1047180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045040, "text": "But I'm not leaving here till I find\nout."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1051040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050040, "text": "Good night, Christine."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1056370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055370, "text": "Call me if you need bail."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1069710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067810, "text": "Oh, I'm sorry, Rosie."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1072130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070350, "text": "Gilda took a cab. She apologized."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1075090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072450, "text": "She, uh... She's feeling a little sick."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1078630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076510, "text": "Guess it was all this bread and butter."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1083030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079690, "text": "Yeah. Christine was feeling a little\nsick, too."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1085130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083790, "text": "Guess it was all that Gilda."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1089770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086930, "text": "Okay, okay, I'll admit she's a little\ndifficult."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1092970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090290, "text": "How about arrogant, manipulative,\ntyrannical?"}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1099470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093590, "text": "I'm really sorry you feel that way,\nbecause your opinion means a lot to me."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1102390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099970, "text": "Obviously, anybody's does but your own."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1104690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102930, "text": "Eugene, where did you go?"}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1108150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105270, "text": "There's no you there anymore."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1111210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109270, "text": "I guess I have mellowed."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1114870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111530, "text": "Mellowed? If you were any more mellow,\nyou'd be dead."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1119650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1116510, "text": "Look, I know I've made some compromises."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1122870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120590, "text": "But a lot of time has gone by."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1128190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124410, "text": "And I just don't want to end up alone,\nRosie."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1132970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131730, "text": "It's rise now."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1138130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133730, "text": "And if you run away from who you are,\nthen you really will be alone."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1142620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139440, "text": "Gene, you're the one who taught me to\nlive for the moment."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1144460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143120, "text": "So take control."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1164480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162560, "text": "Hey, Harry, how was the hockey game?"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1166820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165200, "text": "Oh, it was great."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1174770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172910, "text": "For your information, I was not hit with\na puck."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1176810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175810, "text": "It was a left hook."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1180250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178770, "text": "Harry, you got in a fight with a fan?"}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1181890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180870, "text": "No, with a player."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1186830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183710, "text": "See, the Rangers were ahead, and I got\nkind of excited, and I was yelling,"}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1189970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1186830, "text": "number one, we're number one, and I\nwaved a finger in the air, and I guess"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1194590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189970, "text": "was the wrong finger, because Boone's\ngoalie saw me. He came up in the stands,"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1196710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194610, "text": "he pulled me down, and he started\nbanging my head on the ice."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1200610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198330, "text": "Hey, here you go, slugger."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1205110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202350, "text": "Hey, by the way, did I mention I have\nseason tickets to the roller derby?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1206570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205570, "text": "Hi,"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1216870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1215870, "text": "pumpkin."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1220850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217250, "text": "Don't pumpkin me, Dan Fielding. How dare\nyou treat me the way you did last"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1223470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220850, "text": "night? Dan, what did you do to this poor\ngirl?"}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1225350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224350, "text": "Nothing."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1241540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240400, "text": "talk to me like this before?"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1244160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242520, "text": "Get used to it, jerk face."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1248020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244580, "text": "Because no yuppie trash slimeball creep\nwalks out on me."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1254960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248400, "text": "Now, wait a... Slimeball."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1260480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258120, "text": "Creep. That rings a bell, too."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1263160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262160, "text": "You were saying?"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1269000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264640, "text": "A stinging sensation on my cheek."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1272240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271240, "text": "I remember that, too."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1275500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274280, "text": "Once more, please."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1280720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279480, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1292880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1290200, "text": "It's all coming back to me."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1324680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1321480, "text": "Eugene and I had a nice talk, and I got\ndivorced."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1326899, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325960, "text": "You okay?"}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1327900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326900, "text": "You want to talk?"}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1329960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328140, "text": "Can't. I'm going to Coney Island."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1332020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1330840, "text": "For old time's sake."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1334020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333020, "text": "Kind of."}
